<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-085-B habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.421222" lon="-120.950995"><name>SC26-085-B</name><cmt>SC26-085</cmt><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 7.2 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 66/100; not catch probability. Center 73 ft; nearby 73–96 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-066</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.42809755870971" lon="-120.95506124519872"/><trkpt lat="35.427853329056504" lon="-120.95660938648226"/><trkpt lat="35.42697644258621" lon="-120.95806335365621"/><trkpt lat="35.426264867765966" lon="-120.95863201196302"/><trkpt lat="35.42608464643883" lon="-120.95863656115743"/><trkpt lat="35.42608092269121" lon="-120.95841637912632"/><trkpt lat="35.42554025874839" lon="-120.9584300279368"/><trkpt lat="35.425545844108484" lon="-120.95876029879437"/><trkpt lat="35.425727927064095" lon="-120.95886584051696"/><trkpt lat="35.42464659875883" lon="-120.95889313141198"/><trkpt lat="35.424642875609486" lon="-120.95867295325908"/><trkpt lat="35.424372543536954" lon="-120.95867977649041"/><trkpt lat="35.42437626664931" lon="-120.95889995390861"/><trkpt lat="35.423923851628764" lon="-120.95880123643256"/><trkpt lat="35.4236423